      * RPG cycle without a primary file (RV-60): it repeats until the program sets LR on
     H
     FREPORT  O         132     OA     PRINTER
     C                     ADD  1         COUNT   30
     C           COUNT     COMP 3                    20
     C   20                SETON                     LR
     OREPORT  H  1     1P
     O                                   20 'Counter report'
     OREPORT  D  1
     O                         COUNT     10
     OREPORT  T  2     LR
     O                                   20 'End of report'
